Place these two files here (not committed - binary font files don't belong
in git history for a portfolio repo; add them locally or via your deploy
pipeline's asset step):

  ClashGrotesk-Variable.woff2
  EditorsNote-Regular.otf

Referenced by name in app/globals.css. Without them, the fallback stacks
in tailwind.config.js (bundled Manrope/Fraunces, then system fonts) render
correctly -- nothing breaks, it just isn't the intended type.
